msgid "Dasher collects anonymous usage analytics and crash reports to understand how the app is used and to fix bugs. No typed text, clipboard contents, or personal information is ever collected."
msgstr "Dasher hukusanya takwimu za matumizi zisizo na majina na ripoti za ajali ili kuelewa jinsi programu inavyotumika na kurekebisha mende. Hakuna maandishi yaliyoandikwa, yaliyomo kwenye clipboard, au taarifa binafsi yanayokusanywa kamwe.Dasher collects anonymous usage analytics and crash reports to understand how the app is used and to fix bugs. No typed text, clipboard contents, or personal information is ever collected."

